This repository contains TWO licence regimes. It is NOT a single-licence
project, and the Apache-2.0 licence does NOT apply to the whole tree.

  1. ORIGINAL WORK — Apache-2.0
     Applies to: src/, include/, samples/, dts/, zephyr/, and the
     top-level build files (CMakeLists.txt, Kconfig).
     Full text: LICENSE-APACHE-2.0
     SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

  2. STMicroelectronics RFAL and ST-derived data — SLA0052 (NOT open source)
     Applies to: third_party/st/  and  third_party/elechouse/
     Full text: third_party/st/SLA0052.txt
     Provenance: third_party/st/PROVENANCE.md
     SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-SLA0052

Two SLA0052 conditions materially affect reuse:

  * SECTION 4 — the ST software may be used and executed ONLY in
    combination with an ST-manufactured NFC IC (tag, dynamic tag, NFC
    reader or UHF reader). That condition attaches to the NFC CHIP, not
    to the host processor: driving an ST25R3916/B from a Nordic, NXP or
    any other MCU is permitted. Using these ST sources to drive a
    non-ST NFC front-end is not.

  * SECTION 5 — the ST software must NOT be placed under Open Source
    Terms. Do not relicense this repository wholesale. Do not copy files
    from third_party/ into Apache-, MIT- or GPL-licensed projects as
    though they were covered by those licences.

Every ST file retains its original STMicroelectronics copyright header.
This project is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by, STMicroelectronics.
